\section{The tail}{
At \eqn{\mu = 3} and \eqn{\sigma = 0.8}, compared with a negative binomial of
the same mean and variance (\eqn{\theta = 1/\sigma}, variance 10.2), the mass
at \eqn{y = 20} is \eqn{6.8\times10^{-4}} against \eqn{4.8\times10^{-4}}, at
